950 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Joel is a Collegewise Counselor based in Portland, OR. As a biased Californian, Joel only applied to colleges in his home state. After attending UCLA, he became an Admissions Officer and then Assistant Director that primarily recruited throughout Northern California and the San Francisco Bay Area. He then became a Regional Admissions Representative for UC Santa Cruz and primarily recruited out of state for the Banana Slugs. He has reviewed applications to the UC for nearly a decade including first-year, transfer, and international files. He continues to believe in the power of the UC system, even with all of its challenges and quirks.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [7]
>>
